WEBVTT

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:15.470
I, My, Me! - Strawberry-eggs

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:13.560
A blue sky before the end of the rainy season

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:13.560
Tsuyu ake mae no aozora wa...

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:21.480
makes a heart dance with expectation

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:21.480
hitoashi hayaku kokoro wo odoraseru

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:28.960
Summer is coming yet again

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:28.960
Kotoshi mo mosugu natsuga kuru

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:37.390
The city and people are coming to life bursting with joy

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:37.390
Machi mo hito mo ukare kibun de zawameki dasu

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:46.510
A man who's grown up without losing his boyish heart

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:46.510
Shonen no kokoro no mama otona ni natta hito

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:55.240
We can't go back to the day we met for the first time, but...

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:55.240
Futari deatta anohi ni modorenai kedo...

00:00:57.370 --> 00:01:04.980
If I close my eyes, I can see your smiling face

00:00:57.370 --> 00:01:04.980
Hitomi wo tojireba hohoemu kao ga mieru

00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:12.890
The song we both loved. Do you still sing it?

00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:12.890
Daisuki na ano uta. Ima mo utatte masuka?

00:01:12.890 --> 00:01:20.730
I can still hear that gentle voice and melody

00:01:12.890 --> 00:01:20.730
Watashi ni wa kikoeru. Yasashii koe to melody

00:01:20.730 --> 00:01:30.010
During times of sadness, I will remember you

00:01:20.730 --> 00:01:30.010
Yowaki na toki hodo anata wo omoidasu

00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:40.320
Ba-chan, do you have any
pleated skirts? For the school?

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:42.390
Pleated skirts?

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:44.580
Sannomiya...

00:01:45.670 --> 00:01:48.580
So, now you're a
full-fledged cross-dresser?

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:49.630
Huh?!

00:01:49.710 --> 00:01:51.030
Oh, no, no!

00:01:52.590 --> 00:01:53.590
Like this?

00:01:53.720 --> 00:01:56.050
Thank you for your cooperation!

00:01:56.680 --> 00:01:57.680
Are you ready?

00:02:00.980 --> 00:02:02.270
Just as I thought.

00:02:02.890 --> 00:02:05.980
It drags around the knees
and hinders movement.

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:07.650
You guys get going.

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:13.470
What's this all about?

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:17.930
Well, this skirt is just
not made for sports.

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:20.280
Why do they make
the students wear it?

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:24.030
Oh, you know her.
She's got a fossil for brains.

00:02:24.670 --> 00:02:26.230
Ba-chan, do you carry burumas?

00:02:26.460 --> 00:02:27.160
Burumas?

00:02:32.090 --> 00:02:32.770
Buru...

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:33.800
...ma?

00:02:34.470 --> 00:02:36.340
For Inu-nabe

00:02:38.970 --> 00:02:42.370
Yeah, but what are you up to?

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:44.300
You'll see.

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:47.940
Something's fishy.

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:48.970
Fishy?

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:54.300
Seitow Sannomiya Private School
pleated skirts and burumas...

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:55.900
Maybe...

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:58.640
I can see Fuko-chan in a buruma!

00:02:58.780 --> 00:02:59.620
Great!

00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:15.130
3rd Period
Selfish Blush Magic

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:18.140
Gochiso

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:27.130
My first day as a kyoshi,
I've dreamt of this for so long!

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:30.620
My... my...

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:31.990
Bra!

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:34.720
Yes! My bra... huh?!

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:41.780
Bra Man...

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:49.450
Uh, that's him...

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:54.120
Oh, no, no, I was going to say
I'll show them my way of life.

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:01.100
Ouch!

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:02.540
Are you OK?

00:04:09.730 --> 00:04:12.330
I don't have any money.

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:14.730
Huh?
Calm down, calm down.

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:15.900
Here you go.

00:04:15.990 --> 00:04:18.920
Going to school already?
It's not even seven o'clock.

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:22.360
I have to feed the animals.

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:26.110
Oh, I see.
Food for the rabbits and goldfish.

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:29.110
They're hungry and waiting for me.

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:38.110
I'm pathetically misunderstood.

00:04:38.220 --> 00:04:39.040
Pity...

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:39.340
Faculty Room

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:44.720
"A woman is not happiness.
She exists in place of happiness."

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:48.610
Paul Claudel wrote that in his book.

00:04:49.060 --> 00:04:53.290
That is to say, a woman exists
to bring happiness to the world.

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:55.230
Now, everybody!

00:04:57.190 --> 00:04:58.690
Men are savages!

00:04:58.690 --> 00:04:59.890
Love is all!

00:05:00.030 --> 00:05:01.520
Love to students!

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:04.670
Women are angels!

00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:05.930
Love is all!

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:07.900
Thank you. Keep up the good work.

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:09.630
Thank you.

00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:12.400
My legs fell asleep.

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:17.580
Tofukuji

00:05:19.550 --> 00:05:19.590
Mori Koji

00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:25.170
Those two are unusually
late this morning.

00:05:27.060 --> 00:05:27.090
2-Indigo

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:31.260
- All right!
- Yeah!

00:05:31.270 --> 00:05:32.660
- Wow!
- Pretty!

00:05:32.650 --> 00:05:33.830
- Hibiki-chan!
- We love you!

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:37.070
Hibiki Amawa

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:39.370
There's nothing better than a
young, hot teacher.

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:40.250
How true.

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:43.930
Thank you, my students!

00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:45.410
Amawa-sensei!

00:05:45.580 --> 00:05:46.120
Yes!

00:05:46.370 --> 00:05:48.730
I'll leave them to you.

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:51.180
Yes, yes.

00:05:51.460 --> 00:05:54.320
OK then, let's start homeroom.

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:56.340
I didn't know she's our homeroom teacher.

00:05:55.210 --> 00:05:57.700
You know, I think homeroom
should be a time and place...

00:05:56.340 --> 00:05:57.700
That's right!

00:05:57.800 --> 00:06:01.890
where everyone can
exchange ideas and...

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:01.790
Fuko was so excited
she couldn't sleep last night.

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:03.890
so if you have any ideas...

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:03.890
What a night we had.

00:06:03.890 --> 00:06:07.300
on what kind of activities
we can do together as a class...

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:09.380
feel free to speak up.

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:12.760
Now, let's decide on a member
for the volunteer committee.

00:06:12.980 --> 00:06:16.360
Sensei, what does
the volunteer committee do?

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:18.210
Well, for the first activity...

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:22.400
the second year students are to
visit a retirement home next week.

00:06:22.700 --> 00:06:25.650
We have to prepare for it
starting after class today.

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:26.850
We can't.

00:06:26.950 --> 00:06:28.320
We've got clubs.

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:30.430
Oh, alright, then...

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:32.960
Is there anyone who can do it?

00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:36.450
It says one member
from each homeroom.

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:39.460
All right now, who wants to do it?

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:43.460
Ah, can I do it?

00:06:44.050 --> 00:06:44.960
Kuzuha.

00:06:45.010 --> 00:06:48.040
I like elderly people very much.

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:50.700
OK. Thanks, Kuzuha.

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:51.500
Yes.

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:54.220
Sensei, what are we doing
in the next gym class?

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:55.810
The vaulting horse.

00:06:55.980 --> 00:06:57.870
Ugh, that's bad.

00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:01.510
Oh girls, please remain here.
I have something to tell you.

00:07:16.710 --> 00:07:18.830
What! No way!

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:19.950
Why not!

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:22.620
It's a lot easier to move in them.

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:26.710
They won't twine around your legs.
I think it's a good idea.

00:07:27.260 --> 00:07:31.840
It's true pleated skirts
are hot in the summertime...

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:34.390
old-fashioned and uncool,
but wearing burumas?

00:07:34.560 --> 00:07:35.850
They're too provocative.

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:38.820
Yeah, they'll only please the boys.

00:07:39.230 --> 00:07:42.090
Miho, you want to
please them, don't you?

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:45.170
I understand how you feel.

00:07:45.280 --> 00:07:49.400
But you'll never know unless you try.
Trust me.

00:07:49.410 --> 00:07:50.620
No thanks.

00:08:00.460 --> 00:08:01.960
See, what did I tell you?

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:21.420
Reflection beam!

00:08:22.110 --> 00:08:23.490
The same trick won't work twice!

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:28.520
Forgive me!

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:31.500
What are you doing skipping work?

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:33.300
I took a half day off!

00:08:42.130 --> 00:08:42.940
Bummer.

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:45.300
But Fuko-chan and that
sensei were supposed to...

00:08:48.550 --> 00:08:50.650
I told you not to disgrace Gochiso!

00:08:54.350 --> 00:08:55.330
Next, Kuzuha!

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:56.000
Yes.

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:03.940
So high...

00:09:04.190 --> 00:09:06.820
You'll be fine. I'll help you.

00:09:07.110 --> 00:09:07.860
OK.

00:09:11.910 --> 00:09:13.200
That's all right.

00:09:13.530 --> 00:09:14.220
Try again.

00:09:14.330 --> 00:09:15.790
Here I come!

00:09:27.630 --> 00:09:28.620
Are you OK?!

00:09:31.180 --> 00:09:32.630
Ouch!

00:09:33.970 --> 00:09:34.840
Sensei!

00:09:35.010 --> 00:09:36.020
I'm so sorry.

00:09:36.310 --> 00:09:37.330
It's OK.

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:40.340
It was the pleated skirt
that caused it, right?

00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:44.190
Yes. My legs got caught.

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:45.240
See?

00:09:45.400 --> 00:09:49.020
Listen, we have some time left.
Why don't you try it with the buruma?

00:09:49.240 --> 00:09:50.600
You'll be able to clear it then.

00:09:50.780 --> 00:09:51.320
But...

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:53.260
That's right.
It's too embarrassing.

00:09:53.450 --> 00:09:57.070
Yeah, if you like 'em that much,
why don't you wear one?!

00:09:57.280 --> 00:09:59.390
Eh? Eh? Me?

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:02.270
See, you can't, either.

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:04.150
I'll do it!

00:10:05.130 --> 00:10:06.980
I'll wear the buruma.

00:10:08.630 --> 00:10:09.720
Kuzuha...

00:10:14.010 --> 00:10:15.350
I understand.

00:10:15.640 --> 00:10:17.930
Of course I'll wear one, too.

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:38.560
They'll be able to tell.

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:43.240
What are you doing?!

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:45.270
Ba-chan!

00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:49.410
I brought you a heavy-duty
supporter just in case.

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:50.510
Good thinking...

00:10:55.720 --> 00:10:59.820
Don't stare at me. I'm a man!

00:11:01.310 --> 00:11:03.990
Akira, Kuzuha is pretty hot, isn't she?

00:11:04.190 --> 00:11:04.900
Yeah?

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:06.530
I'll go for Hibiki-chan.

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:08.730
This is disgusting!

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:12.600
Hey! You boys give me 10 laps!

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:15.300
You're interfering! Move!

00:11:15.280 --> 00:11:16.440
You've got to be kidding!

00:11:16.450 --> 00:11:17.940
Why do we have to?!

00:11:17.950 --> 00:11:20.100
We're not interfering!

00:11:22.540 --> 00:11:24.280
OK, let's try again.

00:11:24.290 --> 00:11:25.110
OK.

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:37.210
See! That was great!

00:11:37.510 --> 00:11:39.180
You only made it to here
the last time.

00:11:43.560 --> 00:11:44.750
Buruma!

00:11:45.230 --> 00:11:47.320
Buruma, buruma, buruma!

00:11:48.940 --> 00:11:50.460
Hibiki-chan!

00:11:55.570 --> 00:11:57.500
What were you thinking?

00:11:57.990 --> 00:12:00.630
Those skirts have been
regulation since the founding of...

00:12:00.620 --> 00:12:01.690
With all due respect!

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:04.140
I agree that tradition is important...

00:12:04.540 --> 00:12:06.940
but those skirts are
not suitable for sports!

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:10.500
By wearing a buruma,
Kuzuha was able to jump further.

00:12:10.710 --> 00:12:11.710
Let me ask you then.

00:12:12.090 --> 00:12:17.810
What do you think of the stupid male
students behaving like dogs in heat?

00:12:18.930 --> 00:12:20.640
It's true they are stupid.

00:12:20.890 --> 00:12:23.210
But, that's normal behavior for boys!

00:12:23.310 --> 00:12:24.170
Enough!

00:12:24.390 --> 00:12:26.130
No further discussion is needed.

00:12:26.310 --> 00:12:29.320
From now on, please refrain
from such grandiose displays.

00:12:37.030 --> 00:12:38.090
Oh, sensei!

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:40.270
Did you get in trouble?

00:12:40.530 --> 00:12:41.410
A little.

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:43.920
Drink some milk. You'll feel better.

00:12:43.910 --> 00:12:45.000
Thanks.

00:12:45.290 --> 00:12:47.200
So, how did you like the buruma?

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:49.300
Yes, it was easier to move.

00:12:49.420 --> 00:12:50.220
See!

00:12:50.670 --> 00:12:53.430
Practice in the buruma and
you'll be able to clear the horse.

00:12:53.630 --> 00:12:54.320
Really?

00:12:54.590 --> 00:12:56.560
A gym kyoshi doesn't lie.

00:12:57.050 --> 00:12:58.790
Let's do it again after class.

00:12:59.300 --> 00:13:00.390
In the buruma?

00:13:01.430 --> 00:13:02.720
Are you still embarrassed?

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:07.130
Besides, I have the volunteer
committee work after class.

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:08.350
Oh, that's right.

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:09.650
I'm sorry.

00:13:09.940 --> 00:13:10.660
That's OK.

00:13:11.270 --> 00:13:11.980
What are those?

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:15.500
Lab tools for science class.
I have to put them away.

00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:16.330
I see.

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:18.300
It's nice of you to help your teacher.

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:19.820
Excuse me.

00:13:25.280 --> 00:13:28.440
Somebody please return
these to the preparatory room.

00:13:28.580 --> 00:13:29.860
Gee, I wonder who that will be?

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:31.240
That's a foregone conclusion.

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:32.510
Any volunteers?

00:13:32.960 --> 00:13:33.740
OK.

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:35.200
I'll do it.

00:13:35.920 --> 00:13:36.660
See.

00:13:40.010 --> 00:13:41.580
Ouch!

00:13:42.180 --> 00:13:43.150
Sensei?!

00:13:43.640 --> 00:13:44.630
I'm sorry!

00:13:44.890 --> 00:13:47.390
No, it was my fault.

00:13:48.060 --> 00:13:49.740
Uh, Kuzuha? What are those?

00:13:50.060 --> 00:13:52.100
The maps for social studies.

00:13:52.190 --> 00:13:55.720
Well, but you were just
putting away lab tools.

00:13:55.810 --> 00:13:59.120
Yes. I love both science
and social studies.

00:13:59.320 --> 00:14:00.090
Although...

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:01.400
I don't do well on my exams.

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:06.930
Fuko Kuzuha

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:09.040
Student Council

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:09.040
Pet Care

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:09.040
Environment

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:09.040
Transportation

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:09.030
Health Maintenance

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:09.030
Bulletin Board

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:09.030
Class Committee

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:09.030
Classroom Decoration

00:14:08.620 --> 00:14:09.030
Class Library

00:14:11.460 --> 00:14:13.020
What?!

00:14:13.210 --> 00:14:14.340
Quiet down!

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:18.810
We're going to re-select a member
for the volunteer committee.

00:14:19.130 --> 00:14:20.710
How come?!

00:14:21.130 --> 00:14:23.830
Kuzuha is already a member
of three different committees.

00:14:24.010 --> 00:14:27.800
She's in charge of health maintenance
and the bulletin board for this class.

00:14:28.100 --> 00:14:32.140
It's not right for one student
to take on five or six different jobs.

00:14:32.520 --> 00:14:34.370
Don't you all agree?

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:36.430
Uh, well, I...

00:14:36.520 --> 00:14:37.810
You keep quiet, Kuzuha.

00:14:38.150 --> 00:14:40.510
Amawa-sensei. Amawa-sensei.

00:14:40.780 --> 00:14:43.090
Please report to the
faculty room immediately.

00:14:43.990 --> 00:14:48.180
OK, you can break up after deciding
on a new volunteer committee member.

00:14:48.580 --> 00:14:51.230
Don't leave until it's decided, OK?

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:53.180
Oh, Kuzuha.

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:56.490
We'll practice later,
so wait here for me.

00:14:58.840 --> 00:15:00.300
Fuko. What practice?

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:02.820
Oh, it's nothing.

00:15:04.470 --> 00:15:05.610
What a drag!

00:15:05.680 --> 00:15:06.910
I have to be somewhere.

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:10.810
It's OK everybody, I'll do it.

00:15:10.890 --> 00:15:15.060
Hey, if you want to do it,
why didn't you speak up earlier?

00:15:15.390 --> 00:15:15.930
Sorry.

00:15:15.980 --> 00:15:17.450
OK, we're done!

00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:18.700
Let's go home, Fukae!

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:22.990
Fuko, you want us to do it?

00:15:23.280 --> 00:15:24.010
Yeah.

00:15:24.030 --> 00:15:24.970
But, you can't.

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:27.570
You have a game this Sunday, right?

00:15:27.950 --> 00:15:30.690
You're both starters.
You have to practice.

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:34.900
Where are the others?

00:15:35.250 --> 00:15:37.320
They were all busy, so they left.

00:15:37.670 --> 00:15:38.330
I see...

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:39.440
Sensei.

00:15:39.670 --> 00:15:42.610
Do you think the people at the
retirement home will like this?

00:15:42.670 --> 00:15:43.670
Why do you do this?

00:15:44.720 --> 00:15:46.630
Why do you take
everything on your back?

00:15:50.140 --> 00:15:52.480
I enjoy doing things like this.

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:04.740
What are you brooding about?

00:16:06.070 --> 00:16:08.230
I was remembering back
to my junior-high days.

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:14.070
Are kids at that age
just selfish by nature?

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:15.800
What are you talking about?

00:16:15.830 --> 00:16:17.390
It has nothing to do with age.

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:20.460
Human beings are all selfish.

00:16:31.890 --> 00:16:33.150
What is this?!

00:16:38.940 --> 00:16:41.370
Why aren't any of you
willing to take over?!

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:43.050
Well, it's not like that.

00:16:43.070 --> 00:16:44.360
You keep quiet, Kuzuha!

00:16:44.820 --> 00:16:46.110
What's the problem?!

00:16:46.690 --> 00:16:49.990
She wants to do it.
What's the big deal?

00:16:49.990 --> 00:16:52.290
Right, because Kuzuha
is such a soft-soul.

00:16:53.080 --> 00:16:56.580
But who are you to take advantage
of her soft nature?

00:16:56.830 --> 00:16:58.210
You force all the work on her!

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:00.820
You think if you keep quiet she'll take

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:02.410
everything upon herself, don't you?

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:06.460
"Because she likes to work,
let's just leave everything to her."

00:17:07.300 --> 00:17:08.320
Is that what you think?

00:17:08.880 --> 00:17:11.980
No, you've never even given it
that much thought, have you?

00:17:16.350 --> 00:17:17.680
What are you doing, Fuko?

00:17:18.560 --> 00:17:21.480
Are you practicing vaulting?

00:17:21.850 --> 00:17:22.370
Yeah.

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:27.060
Hibiki-sensei said I'd be able
to clear it, if I practice in a buruma.

00:17:27.530 --> 00:17:30.510
So the "practice" she
was talking about is this?

00:17:30.530 --> 00:17:31.110
Yeah.

00:17:31.240 --> 00:17:32.910
She offered to coach after class.

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:35.490
If you'd said so, I would've
taken over some work.

00:17:35.660 --> 00:17:36.350
Sorry,

00:17:36.370 --> 00:17:39.990
But I didn't want to wear this
at school all by myself, anyway.

00:17:40.460 --> 00:17:42.500
Oh, but watch this.

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:44.060
Ready?
Here I go!

00:17:46.300 --> 00:17:51.230
I'm so close to clearing it for the
first time in my life. I'm very excited!

00:17:55.220 --> 00:17:56.080
Alright, already.

00:17:56.930 --> 00:17:58.830
I'll take over the work.

00:17:59.100 --> 00:18:00.910
I can help, too.

00:18:01.230 --> 00:18:02.590
Me too.

00:18:02.940 --> 00:18:04.980
All right, case closed.

00:18:05.940 --> 00:18:08.140
Stop it! All of you!!

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:11.600
You're completely missing the point!

00:18:11.900 --> 00:18:13.710
I really dislike this attitude of yours!

00:18:12.740 --> 00:18:18.230
Love is All

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:15.380
Look into your own hearts!

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:17.830
You're so young!
And yet your hearts are so foul!

00:18:18.490 --> 00:18:21.360
Yes, there are a lot of
selfish people in this world.

00:18:21.750 --> 00:18:22.960
Yes, it's easier.

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:25.230
You might become
more successful that way.

00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:28.680
But why?

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:31.210
Don't you care about your classmates?!

00:18:31.760 --> 00:18:33.510
Doesn't this make you sad?

00:18:34.220 --> 00:18:36.640
It was only by chance that
you've become classmates!

00:18:36.640 --> 00:18:38.910
But isn't there a bond between you? After all this time?

00:18:42.270 --> 00:18:42.990
Kuzuha!

00:18:43.690 --> 00:18:44.380
Let's go.

00:18:49.320 --> 00:18:50.190
Kuzuha.

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:52.610
Yes.

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:55.390
I'm sorry.

00:19:06.420 --> 00:19:10.170
I think the buruma is better,
but I'll leave it up to you.

00:19:10.340 --> 00:19:10.780
Oh?

00:19:11.170 --> 00:19:12.650
You don't have to feel obligated.

00:19:14.930 --> 00:19:16.010
I'm sorry.

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:18.920
Get ready.
We'll have a class just for you.

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:20.600
OK.

00:19:20.850 --> 00:19:22.030
Wear the buruma.

00:19:23.270 --> 00:19:25.960
Sensei, we'll wear the burumas.

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:29.530
It's about the only thing
we can do to help.

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:32.470
You won't have to feel embarrassed
if we're all wearing them.

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:33.420
Everybody?

00:19:33.530 --> 00:19:36.620
We want you to be excited
about succeeding with the buruma.

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:39.490
So let's all wear them,
even at school.

00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:41.160
We're sorry, Fuko-san.

00:19:41.370 --> 00:19:43.370
We were too dependent on you.

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:45.940
I'll help from now on.

00:19:46.670 --> 00:19:47.600
Me too.

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:48.580
- Me too.
- Me too.

00:19:55.010 --> 00:19:57.190
We're... sorry, too.

00:19:57.340 --> 00:19:58.080
Yeah!

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:11.500
I did it!!

00:20:11.650 --> 00:20:12.640
She did it!

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:14.780
Thanks to the buruma, I guess.

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:16.700
Yeah, it's a lot easier
to move in them.

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:19.330
Amawa-sensei!
What is this?!

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:21.170
What are you doing?!

00:20:21.240 --> 00:20:23.520
Isn't it wonderful?
Look at their smiles.

00:20:23.620 --> 00:20:24.200
What?

00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:27.280
They are enjoying the class
from the bottom of their hearts.

00:20:27.460 --> 00:20:31.080
Physical freedom
releases the mind as well.

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:36.210
Don't you agree,
Principal, Vice-Principal?

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:45.740
And so, burumas became
the school's new gym clothing.

00:20:45.890 --> 00:20:46.710
- Let me down.

00:20:46.730 --> 00:20:48.880
But it was a complete loss for me!

00:20:47.310 --> 00:20:48.810
- I'm hungry.

00:20:50.980 --> 00:20:51.590
Why?

00:20:51.610 --> 00:20:53.940
I was going to make
money on those burumas...

00:20:53.940 --> 00:20:57.520
but the kids bought them in bulk
from the school's official supplier.

00:20:58.110 --> 00:21:01.290
Unsold merchandise?
You can't return them, can you?

00:21:01.450 --> 00:21:02.960
What are you going to do?

00:21:03.330 --> 00:21:04.970
I'll wear them.

00:21:10.120 --> 00:21:16.870
At the train station after school
that's where I look for you

00:21:10.120 --> 00:21:16.870
Hokago no eki kimi wo sagasu.

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:26.230
With my racing heart
can I find you again today?

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:26.230
Doki doki shiteru
kyo mo aeru kana?

00:21:41.400 --> 00:21:48.190
At this train station
I saw you many times before

00:21:41.400 --> 00:21:48.190
Eki no homu de
mikakete ta kimi.

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:55.080
But couldn't talk to you
Not at all

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:55.080
Hajime wa nanimo hanase nakatta.

00:21:55.210 --> 00:22:01.930
Will I find you again tomorrow?

00:21:55.210 --> 00:22:01.930
Moshimo ashita aetara iina?

00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:09.910
Maybe I'll have enough
courage to talk to you

00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:09.910
Youki dashite ieru kamone.

00:22:10.100 --> 00:22:17.040
Even if the sky cries

00:22:10.100 --> 00:22:17.040
Tatoeba sora ga namida shitemo...

00:22:17.020 --> 00:22:25.880
with your smile it's
a sunny day in my eyes

00:22:17.020 --> 00:22:25.880
kimi no egao de hitomi wa hareru yo.

00:22:38.300 --> 00:22:39.320
Mori and!

00:22:38.420 --> 00:22:53.480
Fourth Period "Delicate Tear Concealer"

00:22:39.340 --> 00:22:40.120
Kochi's!

00:22:40.130 --> 00:22:42.060
Homeroom visit!

00:22:42.050 --> 00:22:44.230
Now, what do you
think today's topic is?

00:22:44.220 --> 00:22:45.660
It's so exciting, isn't it?!

00:22:45.680 --> 00:22:49.630
Hey, they can't start the
homeroom if you two are here!

00:22:49.640 --> 00:22:50.670
Huh?!

00:22:50.680 --> 00:22:52.570
Oh, yeah...
